            {
                "comment": "Not a bad class at all...did not like her at all at first but then I got to really like her. She is actually a really nice person. The tests aren't too hard and the mutiple choice questions weren't hard either....all you have to do is study people!",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "She is not nearly as bad as people say she is.  In my experience the people who don't like her are the ones who don't bother to do the readings, talk through class, don't adequately prepare for the exams, and then blame her when they don't get a good grade.  She could improve in some areas, but overall not too bad.",
